model household_b
  tally 1
  on 2026-01-07
  start 2022-03-01
  end 2047-12-31
  note "Household B (tmp/cases/B): Piotr Sowa, a sole trader on the flat rate from 2022-04-11, and Aleksandra (Ola) Wilk, employed by Mewa; not married. One reality (L §6.1): each document is a source, its facts in versions known on the document's day (L §4.5)."
  note "The model's today is 2026-01-07, the dossier's last known day; each question's ask carries its own as known. DUK and FLR are written money DUK / money FLR, read with a minor unit of 0.01 (S:4)."
  note "Law: the parts in tmp/cases/tally-1.0.1/law, copied in (L §6.1). Record exports no text loads (O:B-1) are represented by the rows the asks read, each citing file and line."

